{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231460","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231460","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1423146001:0":{"text":"嚯！是呼金小子！","source_cn":"嚯！是呼金小子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C3796CF63269F8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423146002:0":{"text":"祖娅老师！你还是和以前一样啊！","source_cn":"祖娅老师！你还是和以前一样啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C40018CBBC42BB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423146003:0":{"text":"呼金，你可是变了好多啊！你离开村子那会儿可还是个毛头小子！","source_cn":"呼金，你可是变了好多啊！你离开村子那会儿可还是个毛头小子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x849612DA8B324AF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423146004:0":{"text":"村里的事都大到惊动你出山了吗……","source_cn":"村里的事都大到惊动你出山了吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CAA2250DCFB1194","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423146005:0":{"text":"我得暂时当一段时间村里的负责人了，起码得把这个局面收拾了再说。","source_cn":"我得暂时当一段时间村里的负责人了，起码得把这个局面收拾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02D85E996FC5EE89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423146006:0":{"text":"你怎么突然想起回村的？总不会是因为想我这个老人家吧！","source_cn":"你怎么突然想起回村的？总不会是因为想我这个老人家吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61F5A3FF7DC9CA03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423146007:0":{"text":"我这次也是听说村子出了事，专程回来的……","source_cn":"我这次也是听说村子出了事，专程回来的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7014BFCFC28CC373","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423146008:0":{"text":"对了，祖娅老师！这是铁头，这是尖哨，这是矮地……来，跟祖娅老师打个招呼！","source_cn":"对了，祖娅老师！这是铁头，这是尖哨，这是矮地……来，跟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AAD0A314C62C4B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1423146009:0":{"text":"呼金和祖娅滔滔不绝地叙起了旧……\n让他们师徒单独相处一会儿吧。","source_cn":"呼金和祖娅滔滔不绝地叙起了旧……\\n让他们师徒单独相处...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x227EF3361630723D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"祖娅","source":"祖娅","status":"source"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"呼金","source":"呼金","status":"source"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"黑屏字幕","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":3}}